<title>PERU: Cementos Lima sets $3.287 mln dividend payout.</title>
<headline>Cementos Lima sets $3.287 mln dividend payout.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru's largest cement-maker, Cementos Lima, agreed to a $3.287 million cash dividend for shareholders with a record date of October 28 and a payout date of November 7, a Lima bolsa report said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The dividend is based on 1996 profits.</p>
<p>The report said $0.11 per share would be paid on 26.46 million common shares, while $0.011 would be paid on 34.18 million non-voting labor shares.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
</text>
